@startuml 商品下单时序图
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam defaultFontSize 11

title 体育场馆管理系统 - 商品下单时序图

actor "会员" as Member
participant "前端Vue" as Front
participant "CartController" as CartCtrl
participant "OrdersController" as OrderCtrl
participant "CartService" as CartService
participant "OrdersService" as OrderService
participant "ShangpinxinxiService" as SPService
participant "MySQL" as DB

Member -> Front: 1. 加入购物车
Front -> CartCtrl: 2. POST /cart/add
activate CartCtrl
CartCtrl -> CartService: 3. 插入购物车
activate CartService
CartService -> DB: 4. INSERT INTO cart
DB --> CartService: 5. 成功
CartService --> CartCtrl: 6. 返回结果
deactivate CartService
CartCtrl --> Front: 7. 加入成功
deactivate CartCtrl

Member -> Front: 8. 提交订单
Front -> OrderCtrl: 9. POST /orders/add
activate OrderCtrl

OrderCtrl -> CartService: 10. 查询购物车
activate CartService
CartService -> DB: 11. SELECT * FROM cart
DB --> CartService: 12. 购物车列表
CartService --> OrderCtrl: 13. 购物车数据
deactivate CartService

OrderCtrl -> SPService: 14. 查询商品信息
activate SPService
SPService -> DB: 15. SELECT * FROM shangpinxinxi
DB --> SPService: 16. 商品信息
SPService --> OrderCtrl: 17. 商品数据
deactivate SPService

OrderCtrl -> OrderCtrl: 18. 生成订单号，计算总价
OrderCtrl -> OrderService: 19. 创建订单
activate OrderService
OrderService -> DB: 20. INSERT INTO orders
DB --> OrderService: 21. 成功
OrderService --> OrderCtrl: 22. 订单创建成功
deactivate OrderService

OrderCtrl -> CartService: 23. 清空购物车
activate CartService
CartService -> DB: 24. DELETE FROM cart
DB --> CartService: 25. 删除成功
deactivate CartService

OrderCtrl --> Front: 26. 订单创建成功
deactivate OrderCtrl
Front --> Member: 27. 去支付

@enduml
